      "writtenOn": "2021-01-14T03:49:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One little more context.\n\nThe following CL (aosp/1532512) will add interface in TelephonyManager which has one parameter SignalStrengthUpdateRequest.\n\nAnd the wrapper class make the API extensible. For example, in the same CL, we add a new field mLiveToken into SignalStrengthUpdateRequest (for client liveness monitoring). The API surface does not need to change.",
      "parentUuid": "831bfaca_b0087b23",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 46
