      "writtenOn": "2021-01-14T20:49:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestions. The builder is not created to replace the constructor.\n\nIndeed, The wrapper class with public constructor can only tolerate @hide fields change. If we have public fields change request, it is not flexible enough.",
